{"version":1,"content":"<p>第063版架構指令集擴展編程參考文檔曝光，坐實英特爾下一代處理器迭代路線。文檔詳細列出了代號為Razor Lake的消費級處理器與Coral Rapids伺服器處理器的CPUID識別碼，預示着這兩大架構已進入實質性的開發階段。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586396.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.135001+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:03:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"a6c795dbf455fcc4b0efc8612797b41724922397de78465ce76154ca45f4abc3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}